"""Plans for trip patagonia-new (see trip.json next to this file): quiet, less-visited hikes from Balmaceda.
PLANS[i]["days"] = (title, drive, [hike ids], note, sleep, kind); kind = hike|mix|travel|buffer|trek.
A one-night tent trip uses the same hike id on both days with kind "trek".
BUDGET[num] = (food, fuel, sleeping, fees+ferries, misc, note) in EUR for the whole group.
DRIVE_STOPS[num] = overnight stops for tools/drive.py ("~X" = ferry to X, "(X)" = via-point).
2027 weekdays: Jan 27 = Wed; Mondays are Feb 1, 8 and 15 (CONAF units such as RN Coyhaique, Dos Lagunas and
possibly Tamango and the Chacabuco sector close on Mondays, so no CONAF hikes are planned on those days)."""

